            "review_title": "Review at Aex Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Michelle M\n1 contribution\n0\nCraft cocktails in a classy setting.\nJul 2025 • Solo\nI had a great time. The ambiance, seating and smooth jazz music was perfect for my mood last night .The bartenders were good I was hooked looking at them every time they mix drinks . However, most of the people were in groups or couples if you’re going solo it might feel out of place . I highly recommend for foreigners to visit this place.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 28, 2025",
