            "review_title": "Review at Aex Cocktail Bar",
            "review_text": "Andiez\n2 contributions\n0\nCozy Vibes, Tasty Drinks, Friendly Faces\nDec 2023 • Friends\nAbsolutely loved the cozy ambiance of AEX Cocktail Bar! The warm orange tones create a welcoming atmosphere, making it a perfect spot for both friends and couples.\n\nThe drinks were exceptional, each sip was a burst of flavors that left a lasting impression. The bartender was not only skilled but also incredibly friendly, adding a personal touch to the overall experience.\n\nThe cave-themed concept added a unique charm to the place, making it a great choice for a casual hangout with friends or a romantic date night. Definitely a must-visit for anyone looking for a great atmosphere, delicious drinks, and friendly service. Can't wait to go back!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 26, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
